  "description": {
    "text": "2010 was Challenge Hiroba's last year. The Card Get Battles' silver Victory Medal changed to Typhlosion, 042/L-P, in January and to Feraligatr, 043/L-P, in May, and the Meganium medal 041/L-P was still given. The February launch battles for Reviving Legends gave every player Scyther or Houndour at random, with Legend Box and Burned Tower for runs of wins; those for Lost Link in April gave Zangoose and Lost Remover; and those for Clash at the Summit in July, the last LEGEND expansion, Electabuzz and Indigo Plateau, the same cards as the gyms' launch tournaments and Pokémon Centers. Players got Lapras in May and Shuckle in June.",
    "sources": [
